  unitName: Archangel
  unitId: 50051
  unitNumber: 76
  description: A humanoid with large, pure-white wings on its back. Angels who have
    won numerous battles and considered as suitable commanders are called Archangels.
    People who have received their divine protection and extreme devotion can have
    their minor wounds instantly healed by them. They are more than ruthless and
    will annihilate their enemy without hesitation.
  summonDesc: My sword will condemn evil!<br>If you harbor no guilt<br>then you've
    nothing to fear!
  fusionDesc: Behold my glistening sword!<br>The day for the gods' enemies <br>to
    submit has come!
  evoDesc: The gods have <br>heard your prayers.<br>You have my strength!
